                            	  6811: _L_z01_HandleMonsterWeaponCollision_CheckZolVire:
                            	  6812:     ; If the monster is Zol or Vire, then
                            	  6813:     ;   If not hit by the boomerang, then
                            	  6814:     ;     Set monster's direction to the weapon's
