                            	   767: UpdateBlock_JumpTable:
02:00039FB4 00039FC0        	   768:     dc.l    UpdateBlock0Idle   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039FB8 0003A0AA        	   769:     dc.l    UpdateBlock1Moving   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039FBC 0003A0F4        	   770:     dc.l    UpdateBlock2Done   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
