02:000401C2 00040210        	   196:     dc.l    UpdateMenuCommon1   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:000401C6 00040246        	   197:     dc.l    UpdateMenuCommon2   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
