                            	  5392: _L_z07_UpdateArrowOrBoomerang_CompareLimit:
                            	  5393:     ; For boomerangs, compare it to the movement limit.
                            	  5394:     ; If it reached the limit, set state $20 and a new movement
                            	  5395:     ; limit of $10, and go handle the rest as if blocked.
                            	  5396:     ; State $20 will become $30 below in HandleArrowOrBoomerangBlocked.
                            	  5397:     ;
                            	  5398:     ; Otherwise, only animate and check collision as usual.
                            	  5399:     ;
                            	  5400:     ; In major state $30, ObjMovingLimit is a timer to change the state to $40.
                            	  5401:     ;
