02:0004C715 01
02:0004C716 F9
02:0004C717 07
02:0004C718 FF
02:0004C719 01
02:0004C71A FD
02:0004C71B 03
                            	  5954: 
                            	  5955: ; 4 sets of vertical offsets, one for each state of weapon.
                            	  5956: ; Each set contains 4 offsets in reverse direction index order:
                            	  5957: ; up, down, left, right
